/* 对话页：iOS 消息式的左 AI / 右用户气泡，底部固定输入区，整体沿用全局的墨绿 + 米白配色 */
.chat-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100vh;
  background: var(--paper);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.chat-scroll { flex: 1; min-height: 0; }
.chat-inner { padding: 28rpx 28rpx 20rpx; }

/* 单条消息 */
.msg { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16rpx; margin-bottom: 26rpx; }
.msg.user { flex-direction: row-reverse; }

.avatar {
  width: 64rpx; height: 64rpx; flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--green); color: #fff;
  font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 600;
}

.bubble {
  max-width: 78%;
  padding: 22rpx 26rpx;
  background: #fff;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 10rpx 26rpx 26rpx 26rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(23, 63, 53, .04);
}
/* 带方案卡片时让气泡撑满，卡片才有横向空间 */
.bubble.has-cards { max-width: 100%; flex: 1; }

.msg.user .bubble {
  background: var(--green);
  border-color: var(--green);
  border-radius: 26rpx 10rpx 26rpx 26rpx;
}

.bubble-text { font-size: 27rpx; line-height: 1.78; word-break: break-word; }
.msg.user .bubble-text { color: #fff; }

/* 输入中的三点动画 */
.typing { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10rpx; padding: 28rpx 26rpx; }
.typing-dot {
  width: 12rpx; height: 12rpx; border-radius: 50%;
  background: #B4C4B7;
  animation: typing-bounce 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
}
.typing-dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .18s; }
.typing-dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .36s; }
@keyframes typing-bounce {
  0%, 60%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: .5; }
  30% { transform: translateY(-8rpx); opacity: 1; }
}

/* 方案卡片 */
.cards { margin-top: 20rpx; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18rpx; }
.plan-card {
  padding: 22rpx;
  background: #F8FAF6;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 22rpx;
}
.plan-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16rpx; }
.plan-title { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font-size: 29rpx; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.5; }
.plan-score { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--green); font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 650; }
.plan-score-unit { font-size: 18rpx; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); }
.plan-meta { margin-top: 8rpx; font-size: 22rpx; color: var(--muted); }
.plan-days { margin-top: 14rpx; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8rpx; }
.plan-day { display: flex; gap: 12rpx; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 1.7; }
.plan-day-label { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--green); }
.plan-day-names { color: #48604F; word-break: break-word; }
.plan-reason { margin-top: 14rpx; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); }
.plan-use {
  margin-top: 20rpx; width: 100%;
  padding: 18rpx;
  background: var(--green); color: #fff;
  border-radius: 16rpx; font-size: 26rpx; text-align: center;
}

/* 快捷短语 */
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14rpx; padding: 0 28rpx 16rpx; }
.chip {
  padding: 14rpx 26rpx;
  background: #fff; border: 1rpx solid var(--line); border-radius: 40rpx;
  font-size: 25rpx; color: var(--green);
}
.chip-pressed { background: var(--soft); }

/* 底部输入 */
.composer {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 28rpx calc(16rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .95);
  border-top: 1rpx solid var(--line);
}
.composer-input {
  flex: 1; min-width: 0; height: 84rpx;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  background: #F1F4EE;
  border-radius: 42rpx;
  font-size: 27rpx;
}
.composer-ph { color: #9AA89D; }
.composer-send {
  flex-shrink: 0; width: 132rpx; height: 84rpx;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: var(--green); color: #fff;
  border-radius: 42rpx; font-size: 27rpx;
}

.preview-notice {
  padding: 18rpx 28rpx;
  background: #F0EDE3; color: #776C52;
  font-size: 23rpx; text-align: center;
}
